# Frontend origin(s) for production CORS. Comma-separated list, e.g.
# CLIENT_URL=https://porch.example.com
# When unset, CORS allows all origins (dev default).
CLIENT_URL=https://www.porch-social.com, https://porch-client.onrender.com

# Comma-separated emails that get admin powers when the server boots.
# Admins can delete any post and manage users from the /admin page.
